<ProjectLayout slug="random-box">
  <p>
    <em>Random Box</em> investigates chance, repetition and the
    unexpected relationships that emerge from simple systems.
    Rather than following a fixed narrative, the work embraces
    unpredictability, allowing accidental encounters to shape the
    viewing experience.
  </p>

  <p>
    By continuously rearranging visual elements within a confined
    structure, the animation questions how meaning can arise through
    coincidence and repetition, transforming randomness into an
    evolving visual language.
  </p>

